      "navigation": "Creator Library opens Spatial Studio; the right rail switches between object properties, spatial context and scene settings; clearing selection shows the scene; the Creator returns to the Library.",
      "designTarget": "Use an identity-led Inspector with immediate object actions, a compact stack of common controls, contextual placement and relationship tools, technical precision only at Engineering depth, and three purposeful rail destinations with clear active state.",
